Output docs/media/search.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1640
Set Height 820
Set Padding 14
Set Margin 22
Set MarginFill "#11111b"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set WindowBarSize 36
Set BorderRadius 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Framerate 24
Env COLORTERM truecolor
Env GITPAD_LOGO text
Hide
Type 'cd "$GITPAD_DEMO" && clear && gitpad' Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 600ms
Type "/"
Sleep 400ms
Type "search"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Escape
Sleep 600ms
Type "/"
Right
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "feat"
Sleep 800ms
Screenshot docs/screenshots/branch-picker.png
Down
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Escape
Sleep 600ms
